format council-names-v1
# Council / L1 names — the odd-quorum 5x3 register, pronounceable in the elder
# planet-name style, DNS/social-claimable. Synonyms are paired like OUTFITS but for
# L1 chains, with multichain Mycelium .myc support. Several names already name seated
# things (Mala, Murr, Reya, Gren, Linn, Siya) — their reuse is deliberate multi-role,
# one name many roles. PROPOSED for Keaton's word; a real name is claimed by a real
# hand (.sol/.sui), consent-gated. Companion:
# expanding-prompts/20260810-044453_the-3x39-baton-passports-dividers-and-starseeding.md
stamp 20260810.044453
note proposed; pronounceable, predictably spellable; not real-@p-valid (4+ letter segments)

# --- synonym pairs (long / short), outfits for L1 chains ---
pair murr mur
pair mala mal
pair siya siy
pair wovn wov

# --- the wider council set (segmented from Keaton's run-on; approve or adjust) ---
name kyri     (also the notation and coming voice — multi-role)
name kvez     (as in hqkvez — a headquarters outfit)
name kyli
name maic
name mala     (elder: the ~zod / beresheet revival — multi-role)
name murr     (elder: the MMT / central-bank name — multi-role)
name gren     (elder: the Gren season — multi-role)
name jenad
name jingirr
name reya     (elder: a rested voice — multi-role)
name reeh
name linn     (elder: seated — multi-role)
name laye
name atel
name siya     (elder: the Fund — multi-role)
name wovn
name queyquinqkri  (galaxy — water element, dual mode; benevolent parent of the kyri/kyli voices)
name sunlsiyasuhn  (galaxy — water element, fixed mode; sunl · siya · suhn — deep-blue water, held steady)
name novanethnoel  (galaxy — earth element, dual mode; nova · neth · noel — new ground, gladly given)

# --- galaxy casts: element · mode — seated 20260810.145033 on Keaton's word ---
# TAME-disciplined key-value, one field per line. The maintainer's own galaxy
# (space element, fixed mode) is PRIVATE — its cast lives in /personal/, never here,
# since the name is a seed-scrub identity term.
galaxy queyquinqkri
element water
mode dual
care benevolent
chosen our-galaxy  (Qkri — seated 20260810.145743; the dual-1 of 3 duals yet to configure; voice context/QKRI_VOICE.md)

# --- voice + format nesting under queyquinqkri's benevolent care ---
# The kyri voice/notation and the kyli sibling rest under queyquinqkri rather than
# being molted or debrided away (debride retracted 20260810 on Keaton's word).
nest kyri under queyquinqkri  (the standing voice + the .kyri notation)
nest kyli under queyquinqkri  (sibling voice / format)

# --- galaxy cast: sunlsiyasuhn — seated 20260810.185356 on Keaton's word ---
# Fixed water: deep-blue (sunl ~ Sunil, "deep blue"), the Siya fund, and the
# SUNN journey (suhn) held steady. Water element, fixed mode — the complement to
# queyquinqkri's dual water.
galaxy sunlsiyasuhn
element water
mode fixed

# --- galaxy cast: novanethnoel — seated 20260810 on Keaton's word ---
# Dual earth: new ground (nova), the Neth market surface, gladly given (noel).
# Earth element, dual mode — the earth line's first dual.
galaxy novanethnoel
element earth
mode dual
